{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00164",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.85,
      "end_seconds": 5.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Yeah, good evening, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.55,
      "end_seconds": 11.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.18,
      "end_seconds": 14.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.74,
      "end_seconds": 18.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 19.19,
      "end_seconds": 23.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a tight band-like headache. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.99,
      "end_seconds": 27.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "So, how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.14,
      "end_seconds": 38.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.61,
      "text": "Okay, so I've had it for six months. I've never really been one for hospitals. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.23,
      "end_seconds": 50.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.57,
      "text": "Okay, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.96,
      "end_seconds": 77.51,
      "duration_seconds": 25.55,
      "text": "Rest and a head massage helps a bit. It's worse with long hours on the computer and stress. It just comes and goes. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I've, I've also had trouble sleeping, for three weeks. I've, I've had irritability too, you know, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.85,
      "end_seconds": 79.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Okay. Have you had any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.59,
      "end_seconds": 82.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No fever, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 82.56,
      "end_seconds": 88.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "I mean, actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.38,
      "end_seconds": 93.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.63,
      "end_seconds": 102.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Let me check a few things. Any vomiting, jaw pain when chewing or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.68,
      "end_seconds": 105.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.62,
      "end_seconds": 108.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Any numbness or blurred vision at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.47,
      "end_seconds": 112.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "No, you know, no numbness or blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.99,
      "end_seconds": 115.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.54,
      "end_seconds": 118.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, um, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.69,
      "end_seconds": 122.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.59,
      "end_seconds": 126.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "It's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 127.62,
      "end_seconds": 134.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the escitalopram was 5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.19,
      "end_seconds": 138.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.68,
      "end_seconds": 156.28,
      "duration_seconds": 16.6,
      "text": "Uh, you know, I don't think I have it with me. Well, I'm on ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning. Right, um, I take aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day. It's Combiflam, most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.01,
      "end_seconds": 161.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.69,
      "end_seconds": 163.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.32,
      "end_seconds": 166.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.18,
      "end_seconds": 172.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "I had a stent put in my heart two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.65,
      "end_seconds": 179.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.84,
      "end_seconds": 180.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Yes, anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.0,
      "end_seconds": 182.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.14,
      "end_seconds": 199.37,
      "duration_seconds": 15.23,
      "text": "Hmm, I have high blood pressure. It's the not knowing that gets to me. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I have heart disease. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.75,
      "end_seconds": 208.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.78,
      "end_seconds": 210.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.15,
      "end_seconds": 212.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.29,
      "end_seconds": 216.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.77,
      "end_seconds": 219.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.45,
      "end_seconds": 235.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.24,
      "end_seconds": 254.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 14, pulse is 79 beats a minute, blood pressure 111 over 68, temp 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.88,
      "end_seconds": 259.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.3,
      "end_seconds": 262.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.71,
      "end_seconds": 266.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.86,
      "end_seconds": 276.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Your eye movements and reflexes are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.59,
      "end_seconds": 279.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Look straight ahead for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.7,
      "end_seconds": 299.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "The muscles at the back of your neck are tight and tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.98,
      "end_seconds": 325.77,
      "duration_seconds": 23.79,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a tension-type headache. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'd also keep migraine in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.22,
      "end_seconds": 348.56,
      "duration_seconds": 22.34,
      "text": "We should do an eye check for headache and eye strain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like you to take amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, for six weeks. That should help with headache prevention. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.4,
      "end_seconds": 353.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Alright, um, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.6,
      "end_seconds": 359.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Take a break from the screen every hour and do a few neck stretches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.41,
      "end_seconds": 380.64,
      "duration_seconds": 20.23,
      "text": "Mm. Painkillers on most days can actually make the headaches stick around. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I'd like you to see physiotherapy as well, and I'll write the referral. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.74,
      "end_seconds": 384.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.04,
      "end_seconds": 397.66,
      "duration_seconds": 12.62,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Let's review you in a month. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.0,
      "end_seconds": 400.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}